# Files that must not be deployed. Vercel serves every file outside api/ as a
# public static asset, so anything listed here would otherwise be downloadable.
# requirements.txt stays: Vercel needs it to install the Python packages.

# One-time and local-only scripts (schema, grants, seed data, dev server, tests)
/scripts

# Project notes and tooling, not part of the website
/CLAUDE.md
/INSTALLED-SKILLS.md
/README.md
/graphify-out
/.claude
/.vscode

# Local secrets (also git-ignored, listed here as a second guard)
.env
.env.*
